{
  "Represents a person with a picture, initials or an icon, with an optional presence indicator on its corner. A group stacks or spreads avatars and counts the ones it does not show.": "",
  "Picture, initials and icon": "",
  "The picture appears once it has loaded. Until then, or if it fails to load, the initials appear. Without a name, the person icon appears.": "",
  "Tones and shapes": "Tonlar ve şekiller",
  "Sizes and presence": "Boyutlar ve durum",
  "`max` sets how many avatars are shown, and the rest are counted in a `+N`. `total` also counts people who are not provided. The group sets the size of all its avatars.": "",
  "With a name or label, the avatar is an image with that name (`role=\"img\"`), and the presence follows it (“Ada Lovelace, Away”).": "",
  "An avatar with no name, label or presence is hidden from screen readers.": "",
  "The picture has an empty `alt`, because the avatar carries the name.": "",
  "`role=\"group\"` with its label. The `+N` states how many people are not shown (“8 more people”).": "",
  "Presence is not conveyed by color alone. It is included in the name screen readers announce, and Fluent draws a mark in the dot.": "",
  "Initials use the capitalization rules of the kit language (`uiLocale`), so “ilgin” becomes “İ” in Turkish. The presence and `+N` strings are kit strings (`presenceOnline` … `presenceOffline`, `avatarPresence`, `moreItems`, `avatarGroupMore`) and change with the language.": "",
  "The avatar. `data-size`, `data-shape`, `data-tone`.": "Avatar. `data-size`, `data-shape`, `data-tone`.",
  "The picture. `data-pending` until it loads.": "Resim. Yüklenene kadar `data-pending`.",
  "The initials, and the person icon shown without them.": "Baş harfler ve onlar yokken gösterilen kişi icon'u.",
  "The presence dot. `data-status`.": "Durum noktası. `data-status`.",
  "The group. `data-size`, `data-layout`. An avatar that is not shown has `data-beyond`.": "",
  "The `+N` avatar.": "`+N` avatarı.",
  "Unit: the avatar at rest (the standard tone) and in each tone.": "Unit: dinlenirken (standart ton) ve her tonda avatar.",
  "Units: the person icon, the presence dot and its ring per status, and a mark inside the dot per status.": "",
  "The avatar, its initials, its icon, its dot and its square corners, per size.": "Boyuta göre avatar, baş harfleri, icon'u, noktası ve kare köşeleri.",
  "The default tone and shape.": "",
  "Unit: the ring that separates a stacked avatar from the one it overlaps.": "",
  "The overlap of stacked avatars, the gap between spread avatars, and the default layout.": "",
  "Avatar props": "Avatar prop'ları",
  "The picture. Until it loads, or if it fails, the initials appear, or the person icon if there are none.": "",
  "The person's name. It is used to create the initials and is announced by screen readers.": "",
  "Custom initials that replace the ones created from `name`.": "",
  "The text screen readers announce instead of the name.": "",
  "`xs`, `sm`, `md`, `lg` or `xl`. In a group, the group's size applies.": "",
  "Set by the design language (`circle`)": "",
  "`circle` or `square` (using the design language's corner radius for the size).": "",
  "`standard`, `accent`, `info`, `success`, `caution`, `danger`, or `auto`, which derives a tone from the name so the same name always has the same tone. Material and Lilac use `accent`, and the others use `standard`.": "",
  "`online`, `away`, `busy` or `offline`: a presence dot on the lower end corner.": "",
  "Avatar properties": "Avatar property'leri",
  "The displayed initials: the ones provided, otherwise the ones created from the name.": "",
  "Indicates whether the picture has loaded and is currently shown.": "",
  "AvatarGroup props": "AvatarGroup prop'ları",
  "The size of every avatar in the group.": "",
  "Set by the design language (`stack`)": "",
  "`stack` overlaps each avatar on the previous one, and `spread` places them side by side.": "",
  "The maximum number of avatars shown. The others are counted in a `+N` after them.": "",
  "The total number of people when only some are provided. The rest are counted in the `+N`.": "",
  "The accessible name of the group (“Members”).": "",
